<title>USA: Epitope to spin off agriculture unit.</title>
<headline>Epitope to spin off agriculture unit.</headline>
<dateline>BEAVERTON, Ore. 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Epitope Inc said Monday it will spin off its agricultural biotechnology unit as part of a plan adopted last year to separate the agricultural and medical products business units.</p>
<p>The company also said it will re-acquire from SmithKline Beecham Plc all rights to its patented oral fluid diagnostics technology, which makes a oral HIV testing system SmithKline markets under the name OraSure.</p>
<p>Terms of the deal were not disclosed.</p>
</text>
